@api = http://localhost:5100

### 1. GET / -> Trang chủ (Root)
GET {{api}}/

### 2. GET /api/products -> 200 (Danh sách sản phẩm)
GET {{api}}/api/products

### 3. GET /api/products/1 -> 200 (Chi tiết sản phẩm)
GET {{api}}/api/products/1

### 4. GET /api/products/999 -> 404 + ApiError (Sản phẩm không tồn tại)
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### 5. GET /api/products/abc -> 404 rỗng (ID không phải số)
GET {{api}}/api/products/abc

### 6. POST hợp lệ -> 201 Created + Location
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### 7. POST giá âm -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham loi",
  "description": "Gia am",
  "price": -1
}

### 8. POST thiếu Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/products

{
  "name": "Loi Content Type",
  "description": "Thieu header",
  "price": 10000
}